### 4. COMPRADOR (Carrito)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Ver catálogo
GET {{url}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Añadir al carrito
POST {{url}}/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id_product": 1,
    "quantity": 2
}

### Ver mi carrito
GET {{url}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Finalizar compra (Checkout)
POST {{url}}/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id_delivery_point": 1
}

