### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Ver mis compras
GET {{url}}/sales/my-purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Valorar la compra
POST {{url}}/reviews/store
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id_sale": 1,
    "calification": 5,
    "comment": "Muy rico todo"
}

